---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
import Bio from '../components/Bio.astro'
---

<Layout
  title="About · Pytka.xyz"
  description="About Teodor Pytka, a full-stack developer in Warsaw, Poland, open to short-term consulting."
>
  <main
    transition:animate="fade"
    class="flex flex-col items-start gap-16 pb-12"
  >
    <section class="prose max-w-none">
      <h1
        class="not-prose mb-6 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-mono font-medium tracking-tight text-ink"
      >
        Teodor Pytka
      </h1>
      <Bio />
      <p class="font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed">
        Actively exploring Elixir and the mobile landscape, mainly by writing
        the <a
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          href="https://github.com/kartacze/turpia"
          target="_blank"
          class="underline">Turpia</a
        > application, which is currently a work in progress.
      </p>
      <p class="font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed">
        I'm open to short-term consulting work. I have over eight years of
        experience building web applications, focusing on the frontend but also
        covering serverless scenarios and the backend when needed. I can help
        you assess the state of your application, analyze issues and support
        stable growth. If you're interested, send me an email at{' '}
        <a class="underline" href="mailto:teodorpytka@gmail.com"
          >teodorpytka@gmail.com</a
        >.
      </p>
      <p class="font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed">
        You can find my résumé{' '}
        <a class="underline" href="/A_CV_TEODOR_PYTKA.pdf">here</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
